    private string GetMatchSettings() => @"MATCH SETTINGS GUIDE
=====================

TheStarterPack.txt is the main config file for match mechanics.

LOADOUT FORMAT
--------------
Loadouts=(Name):(percentage)%(ItemID):(Qty),(ItemID):(Qty),.../(next)
Max quantity per cell: 255. Each loadout ends with /

LOADOUT CHAINS (GunGame)
------------------------
Type 'Loadouts=GunGame/...' to advance on kill.
Match KillsToWin to the number of loadouts.
Use ForceKillAtStart=true!

REVERSE GUN GAME
-----------------
Type 'Loadouts=ReverseGunGame/...' to advance on death.
Needs 2 empty loadouts at the beginning.

KEEP INVENTORY (Scavenge)
--------------------------
Type 'Loadouts=KeepInventory/...' to keep items after death.
Do NOT combine with GunGame.

RING SETTINGS (game_settings.txt)
----------------------------------
RingSizes=200, 200, 200
RingSpeeds=35, 35, 35
For deathmatch (no ring): RingSizes=244,244,244 RingSpeeds=0.001,50,0.001

OTHER SETTINGS
--------------
WinCondition=Default|KillsToWin|Debug
ForceKillAtStart=true|false
DropItemsOnDeath=true|false
HealOnKill=true|false
HealOnKillAmount=20
CanGoDown=true|false
SpelldropEnabled=true|false
PreMatchTimeout=15
PeriMatchTimeout=15

SPAWN POINTS
------------
ValidSpawnPoints=0-5 (predefined) or 6 (custom)
